{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/southfloridatrikketours/items/107989/", "pk": 107989, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/southfloridatrikketours/", "pk": 5133, "shortname": "southfloridatrikketours", "name": "Miami Beach Bike Rental & Segway tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Everglades Airboat Adventure + FREE 2 HOURS with Rentals.", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 3, "unicode": "Everglades Airboat Adventure + FREE 2 HOURS with Rentals.", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 6.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 6.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": 15, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": 15, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 9350, "description": "#See the wildlife including alligators Show, birds, snakes and various reptiles.\n\n##Duration\n4.5 hours\n\n##About\nGo from the Art Deco District  to the Everglades National Park on this 4.5-hour entertaining and educational guided tour. Leave wild South Beach behind for another kind of wild: flora- and fauna-loaded Florida Everglades. See alligators, turtles and all manner of birds in their natural habitat.\nMeet in the middle of South Beach's Art Deco district and then get whisked out of Miami to the wild Everglades. Learn about the flora and fauna of the Everglades from the guide on this 4.5-hour tour. Once there, hop on an airboat and skim the water, zipping around a 1.5-million-acre subtropical ecosystem.  \n\nSee indigenous wildlife including alligators, birds, snakes and various reptiles before heading to an alligator farm, an area that is literally crawling with the continent's largest reptiles. See caimans, crocodiles and other species and learn the difference between them. You will also learn about how the ancient American-Indian captured alligators.  \n\nFinally, make the comfortable drive back to Miami, getting dropped off where the tour began.\n\nRemember that you have 2 FREE hours with any rentals.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "233 14th Street Miami Beach, FL 33139", "booking_notes": "Please be at the shop 15 minutes before your tour starting time.\nFor your security, at check-in you are required to present the credit card that was used to pay for your booking and matching valid photo identification. The name listed on your credit card must be identical to the contact name listed on your booking.\n\nDeparture location\nMiami Beach Bike Rental Shop\n233 14th Street \nMiami Beach, FL 33139\nTours run rain or shine. Instances of severe weather will be addressed on the day of the program. Cancellation may only be cancelled 24 hours in advance for full refund.\n\nWelcome to South Beach!", "cancellation_notes": "For your security, at check-in you are required to present the credit card that was used to pay for your booking and matching valid photo identification. The name listed on your credit card must be identical to the contact name listed on your booking.\n\nDeparture location\nMiami Beach Bike Rental Shop\n233 14th Street \nMiami Beach, FL 33139\n\nTours run rain or shine. Instances of severe weather will be addressed on the day of the program. Cancellation may only be cancelled 24 hours in advance for full refund.\n\nWelcome to South Beach!", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline